tact\nMain Menu Social Links\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nThreads\nTikTok\nFacebook\nYouTube\nUtility Menu\nPrograms\nFinancial Aid\nNews\nAbout\nUtility Button Menu\nGet Help\nApply\nGive\nMenu\nFunding and Aid\nThe Harvard Kenneth C. Griffin Graduate School of Arts and Sciences offers a comprehensive program of financial support that includes grants and fellowships.\nAbout\nDean\nOffices\nStaff Directory\nCommittees\nMedia\nHistory\nContact\nAcademics\nAdvising\nDissertation\nFellowships\nMaximizing Your Degree\nTeaching\nWriting\nPrograms\nLife Sciences\nPolicies (Student Handbook)\nAlumni\nAccess\nAlumni Council\nGive\nRecognize\nStudent Engagement\nVolunteer\nColloquy Magazine\nApply\nApplying to Degree Programs\nApplying to the Visiting Students Program\nAdmissions Policies\nCost of Attendance\nExpress Interest\nCampus Safety\nCommencement\nCulture, Community, and Engagement\nCulture, Community, and Engagement Fellows\nStudent Affinity Groups\nRecruitment and Engagement\nFunding Opportunities\nFinancial Support\nFind Your Financial Aid Officer\nCost of Attendance 2026\u20132027\nFunding and Aid\nPhD Degree Funding\nMaster's Degree Funding\nLoans and Federal Work-Study\nOther Sources of Support\nEmergency Hardship Funding\nTaxes\nRegulations Regarding Employment\nFinancial Wellness\nStudent Affairs\nStudent Center\nStudent Services\nStudent Success\nAdmitted Students\nIncoming Students\nHousing\nNews\nCalendar\nResources\nGrants and fellowships come from internal and external sources, traineeships, teaching fellowships, research assistantships, other academic employment opportunities, and several types of loans.\nOur financial aid program features guaranteed funding for the first five years to all PhD students, and a variety of funding options and fellowships for other students. Students can also connect with the Fellowships & Writing Center for advising on internal and external awards.\nContact\nFinancial Aid\nAddress\nRichard A. and Susan F. Smith Campus Center\n1350 Massachusetts Avenue, Suite 350\nCambridge, MA 02138-3654\nEmail\ngsasfinaid@fas.harvard.edu\nPhone\n617-495-5396\nSHARE\nFOUND WHAT YOU NEEDED?\nShare this page\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedIn\nEmail\nSHARE\nFOUND WHAT YOU NEEDED?\nShare this page\nFacebook\nTwitter\nLinkedIn\nEmail\nEvents Calendar\nExplore Events\nView All Events\nView Academic Calendar\nThe Harvard Kenneth C. Griffin Graduate School of Arts and Sciences is a leading institution of graduate study, offering PhD and select master\u2019s degrees as well as opportunities to study without pursuing a degree as a visiting student.\nHarvard University\nRichard A. and Susan F. Smith Campus Center\n1350 Massachusetts Avenue, Suite 350\nCambridge, MA 02138-3654\nContact\nTel: 617-495-5315\nFax: 617-495-2928\nEmail: gsas@fas.harvard.edu\nAdditional Resources\nPrivacy\nAccessibility\nDigital Accessibility\nReport Copyright Infringement\nMap\n\u00a9 2026 The President and Fellows of Harvard College\nMain Menu Social\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nThreads\nTikTok\nFacebook\nYouTube", "links": [["Skip to main content", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/financial-support/funding-and-aid#main-content"], ["", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/"], ["About", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/about"], ["Dean", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/about/dean"], ["Offices", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/offices"], ["Staff Directory", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/directory/staff"], ["Committees", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/about/committees"], ["Media", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/about/media"], ["History", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/about/history-0"], ["Contact", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/about/contact"], ["Academics", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/academics"], ["Advising", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/academics/advising"], ["Dissertation", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/academics/dissertation"], ["Fellowships", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/academics/fellowships"], ["Maximizing Your Degree", "https://gsas.harvard.edu/academics/maximizing-your-degree"], ["Teaching", "https://gsas.harvard.edu